    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665020/extras/fc57f7bfe93d677791be8561b7ba295d.poster.avif?t=1755200685\" width=700 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665020/extras/fc57f7bfe93d677791be8561b7ba295d.webm?t=1755200685\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665020/extras/fc57f7bfe93d677791be8561b7ba295d.mp4?t=1755200685\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You awaken disoriented, tattooed and abandoned in a hellish warzone with no memory of how you arrived. The distant gunfire is the least of your worries as glowing-eyed cultists emerge from the shadows, their unintelligible screams pierce the chaos as they charge clumsily toward you.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>\u00a0 </i></strong><i>Find out what you're made of in this <strong>unique blend of RNG and skill-based progression</strong></i><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665020/extras/67e87ba6a5193e34532392b3d8f84656.poster.avif?t=1755200685\" width=780 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665020/extras/67e87ba6a5193e34532392b3d8f84656.webm?t=1755200685\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665020/extras/67e87ba6a5193e34532392b3d8f84656.mp4?t=1755200685\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive</strong> as long as you can and <strong>command your rats</strong> to <strong>explode corpses</strong> of slain enemies to improve your chances of survival </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Compete</strong> in the <strong>Global Leaderboards</strong> to fight for the\u00a0 top rank of the &quot;Highest Wave Survived&quot; or the high score in the <strong>Basketball Minigame </strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665020/extras/55d5dffd7ac9064d9222c09004b7edb7.poster.avif?t=1755200685\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665020/extras/55d5dffd7ac9064d9222c09004b7edb7.webm?t=1755200685\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665020/extras/55d5dffd7ac9064d9222c09004b7edb7.mp4?t=1755200685\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drink</strong> from the <strong>Cream Machine</strong> to build your character in unique ways</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665020/extras/76badcca7a302ff2b42b8712f8e48bb1.poster.avif?t=1755200685\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665020/extras/76badcca7a302ff2b42b8712f8e48bb1.webm?t=1755200685\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665020/extras/76badcca7a302ff2b42b8712f8e48bb1.mp4?t=1755200685\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022Six unique weapons (M1 Garand, M1A1 Thompson, Walther PPK, Combat Knife, Trenchgun, and Kar98) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022Blood, gore/dismemberment, custom procedural animation, and enemy AI was designed from the ground-up to make every play session feel unique and satisfying </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665020/extras/fc57f7bfe93d677791be8561b7ba295d.poster.avif?t=1755200685\" width=700 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665020/extras/fc57f7bfe93d677791be8561b7ba295d.webm?t=1755200685\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665020/extras/fc57f7bfe93d677791be8561b7ba295d.mp4?t=1755200685\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You awaken disoriented, tattooed and abandoned in a hellish warzone with no memory of how you arrived. The distant gunfire is the least of your worries as glowing-eyed cultists emerge from the shadows, their unintelligible screams pierce the chaos as they charge clumsily toward you.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>\u00a0 </i></strong><i>Find out what you're made of in this <strong>unique blend of RNG and skill-based progression</strong></i><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665020/extras/67e87ba6a5193e34532392b3d8f84656.poster.avif?t=1755200685\" width=780 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665020/extras/67e87ba6a5193e34532392b3d8f84656.webm?t=1755200685\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665020/extras/67e87ba6a5193e34532392b3d8f84656.mp4?t=1755200685\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive</strong> as long as you can and <strong>command your rats</strong> to <strong>explode corpses</strong> of slain enemies to improve your chances of surviva